# Helper build output, written by `make helpers` and embedded by
# //go:embed all:artifacts. The binaries themselves are never committed; this
# committed .gitignore is what lets a fresh checkout COMPILE — the all:
# prefix includes dotfiles, so the embed always matches at least this file,
# and Artifact answers ErrArtifactsNotBuilt until the artifacts exist.
nocx-helper-*.gz
